[6.495455, "o", "docs/install/arch.md:3:Peasant `v0.1.0` is distributed to Arch through the official static Linux release\r\ndocs/install/arch.md:8:> **Availability:** `peasant-bin` is not published for `v0.1.0`. Release candidates\r\ndocs/install/arch.md:15:VERSION=0.1.0\r\ndocs/install/macos.md:16:VERSION=0.1.0\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:20:VERSION=0.1.0                       # the release you want, without the leading \"v\"\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:39:version comparison upgrades in place. Release-candidate packages (`0.1.0~rc1`) sort\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:40:*older* than their final (`0.1.0`), so an rc upgrades cleanly to the final.\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:59:VERSION=0.1.0\r\ndocs/install/windows.md:19:$Version = '0.1.0'\r\ndocs/install/windows.md:50:$Version = '0.1.0'\r\n"]
[6.50647, "o", "README.md:916:> Distinct from the **`github.com/peasant-labs/schema` module version** (`v0.1.0`, published), which is how\r\n"]
[9.566302, "o", "\r\n-- ubuntu.md Option B, followed literally (up to download step):\r\n\r\n$ sed -n '/## Option B/,/^curl/p' docs/install/ubuntu.md | head -12\r\n"]
[9.589925, "o", "## Option B — raw binary tarball\r\n\r\nNo package database entry; you manage the binary yourself.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nVERSION=0.1.0\r\nARCH=amd64    # or arm64\r\n\r\ncurl -fLO \"https://github.com/peasant-labs/peasant/releases/download/v${VERSION}/peasant_${VERSION}_linux_${ARCH}.tar.gz\"\r\n"]
[9.593355, "o", "\r\n$ VERSION=0.1.0; ARCH=amd64; echo VERSION=$VERSION\r\nVERSION=0.1.0\r\n"]
[9.593408, "o", "\r\n$ URL=\"https://github.com/peasant-labs/peasant/releases/download/v${VERSION}/peasant_${VERSION}_linux_${ARCH}.tar.gz\"; echo $URL\r\n"]
[9.593442, "o", "https://github.com/peasant-labs/peasant/releases/download/v0.1.0/peasant_0.1.0_linux_amd64.tar.gz\r\n\r\n$ curl -sIL -o /dev/null -w 'HTTP %{http_code}\\n' \"$URL\"\r\n"]
[13.245067, "o", "HTTP 200\r\n"]
[13.356202, "o", ">> The URL works - and installs peasant 0.1.0, long superseded.\r\n\r\n$ gh release view --repo peasant-labs/peasant --json tagName --jq .tagName\r\n"]
[14.197631, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
[20.329755, "o", "\u001b]11;?\u001b\\\u001b[6n"]
