[33.2914, "o", "docs/install/arch.md:15:VERSION=$(curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/peasant-labs/peasant/releases/latest | sed -n 's/.*\"tag_name\": *\"v\\([^\"]*\\)\".*/\\1/p')   # latest release; pin one with e.g. VERSION=0.12.0\r\ndocs/install/arch.md:16:: \"${VERSION:?could not read the latest release (GitHub API rate limit?); set VERSION=0.12.0 by hand}\"\r\ndocs/install/macos.md:16:VERSION=$(curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/peasant-labs/peasant/releases/latest | sed -n 's/.*\"tag_name\": *\"v\\([^\"]*\\)\".*/\\1/p')   # latest release; pin one with e.g. VERSION=0.12.0\r\ndocs/install/macos.md:17:: \"${VERSION:?could not read the latest release (GitHub API rate limit?); set VERSION=0.12.0 by hand}\"\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:20:VERSION=$(curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/peasant-labs/peasant/releases/latest | sed -n 's/.*\"tag_name\": *\"v\\([^\"]*\\)\".*/\\1/p')   # latest release; pin one with e.g. VERSION=0.12.0\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:21:: \"${VERSION:?could not read the latest release (GitHub API rate limit?); set VERSION=0.12.0 by hand}\"\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:40:version comparison upgrades in place. Release-candidate packages (`0.1.0~rc1`) sort\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:41:*older* than their final (`0.1.0`), so an rc upgrades cleanly to the final.\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:60:VERSION=$(curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/peasant-labs/peasant/releases/latest | sed -n 's/.*\"tag_name\": *\"v\\([^\"]*\\)\".*/\\1/p')   # latest release; pin one with e.g. VERSION=0.12.0\r\ndocs/install/ubuntu.md:61:: \"${VERSION:?could not read the latest release (GitHub API rate limit?); set VERSION=0.12.0 by hand}\"\r\n"]
